{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udd86 Welcome to <i>Feeding My Ducks</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/extras/fc7cf825432f027fc93df1f91910f4c0.poster.avif?t=1770585960\" width=1170 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/extras/fc7cf825432f027fc93df1f91910f4c0.webm?t=1770585960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/extras/fc7cf825432f027fc93df1f91910f4c0.mp4?t=1770585960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever dreamed of running your own duck ranch? Probably not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now you can and it\u2019s way more fun than you\u2019d expect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feeding My Ducks</strong> is a cozy idle game where you feed, train, and evolve a flock of adorable ducks while you work, study, or chill. Watch them grow, compete in mini-games, and transform into quirky evolutions you never saw coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/extras/42554a61fc8a616822c3e0b8d9d572e6.poster.avif?t=1770585960\" width=798 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/extras/42554a61fc8a616822c3e0b8d9d572e6.webm?t=1770585960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/extras/42554a61fc8a616822c3e0b8d9d572e6.mp4?t=1770585960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf5e Feed &amp; Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every duck loves snacks\u2014but what you feed them actually matters.<br>Bread, seeds, veggies, or something\u2026 stranger\u2014each boosts their stats in different ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VIT - Vitality</strong> \u2764\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POW - Power</strong> \ud83d\udcaa</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPD - Speed</strong> \ud83d\udca8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INT - Intelligence</strong> \ud83e\udde0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHM - Charm</strong> \u2728</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level them up, evolve them into bizarre new forms, and discover which combos unlock the rarest ducks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Quirky Duck Mini-Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your flock to the test in lighthearted competitions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timber Trials</strong> \u2013 Ducks with axes. Enough said.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feather Dash</strong> \u2013 Who\u2019s the fastest bird on the ranch?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quack Fu\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Feathery sparring matches full of ducky drama.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each contest boosts different stats, making every duck unique.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 Build Your Ranch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just about feeding. Grow and explore:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm crops</strong> to keep your ducks well-fed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast a line</strong> and fish up dinner\u2014or something rarer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wander the grasslands</strong> to uncover hidden critters and treasures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ranch grows alongside your flock, filled with life, charm, and just a touch of chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcbb Play While You Work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best part? You don\u2019t need to grind.<br><i>Feeding My Ducks</i> is built to run in the background while you get things done.<br>Check in for a quick feed, watch your ducks evolve, or run a contest\u2014then get back to whatever you were doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s progress without pressure. Ducks without deadlines.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032200?t=1770585960","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032200?t=1770585960","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/6d0df8f347669d16dbca47b7aa441141e1af5cca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770585960","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/6d0df8f347669d16dbca47b7aa441141e1af5cca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770585960","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4333260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udd86 Welcome to <i>Feeding My Ducks</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/extras/fc7cf825432f027fc93df1f91910f4c0.poster.avif?t=1770585960\" width=1170 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/extras/fc7cf825432f027fc93df1f91910f4c0.webm?t=1770585960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/extras/fc7cf825432f027fc93df1f91910f4c0.mp4?t=1770585960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever dreamed of running your own duck ranch? Probably not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now you can and it\u2019s way more fun than you\u2019d expect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feeding My Ducks</strong> is a cozy idle game where you feed, train, and evolve a flock of adorable ducks while you work, study, or chill. Watch them grow, compete in mini-games, and transform into quirky evolutions you never saw coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/extras/42554a61fc8a616822c3e0b8d9d572e6.poster.avif?t=1770585960\" width=798 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/extras/42554a61fc8a616822c3e0b8d9d572e6.webm?t=1770585960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/extras/42554a61fc8a616822c3e0b8d9d572e6.mp4?t=1770585960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf5e Feed &amp; Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every duck loves snacks\u2014but what you feed them actually matters.<br>Bread, seeds, veggies, or something\u2026 stranger\u2014each boosts their stats in different ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VIT - Vitality</strong> \u2764\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POW - Power</strong> \ud83d\udcaa</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPD - Speed</strong> \ud83d\udca8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INT - Intelligence</strong> \ud83e\udde0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHM - Charm</strong> \u2728</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level them up, evolve them into bizarre new forms, and discover which combos unlock the rarest ducks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Quirky Duck Mini-Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your flock to the test in lighthearted competitions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timber Trials</strong> \u2013 Ducks with axes. Enough said.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feather Dash</strong> \u2013 Who\u2019s the fastest bird on the ranch?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quack Fu\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Feathery sparring matches full of ducky drama.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each contest boosts different stats, making every duck unique.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 Build Your Ranch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just about feeding. Grow and explore:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm crops</strong> to keep your ducks well-fed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast a line</strong> and fish up dinner\u2014or something rarer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wander the grasslands</strong> to uncover hidden critters and treasures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ranch grows alongside your flock, filled with life, charm, and just a touch of chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcbb Play While You Work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best part? You don\u2019t need to grind.<br><i>Feeding My Ducks</i> is built to run in the background while you get things done.<br>Check in for a quick feed, watch your ducks evolve, or run a contest\u2014then get back to whatever you were doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s progress without pressure. Ducks without deadlines.</p>","developers":["Boundless Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032200/6962a38db6e0cc2e6af67e4107e601eae7fe7e81/header.jpg?t=1770585960","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4032200/1691305322/b52e7abe1365fb