01.600x338.jpg?t=1770585960"}],"short_description":"Feeding My Ducks is a cozy idle-management game where you raise, train, and evolve a flock of lovable ducks. Feed them, progress their stats, and watch them transform into surprising new forms\u2014all while the game runs peacefully in the background as your productivity companion.","steam_appid":4032200,"support_info":{"email":"devboundless@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}